error: `total` uses `Cell` only to access and replace a copyable value
 --> tools/dylint/examples/needless_cell.rs:7:5
  |
7 |     let total = Cell::new(0);
  |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  |
  = help: bind the value with `let mut total`, use reads and assignment, and use `core::mem::replace` or `core::mem::take` for returned old values
  = note: `#[deny(needless_cell)]` on by default

